'''The Jansen Stead''' is the northernmost [[farm]] in [[Westfall]], and is located near the border with [[Elwynn Forest]]. Like most of the farms in Westfall, the owners have been driven off by the [[Defias Brotherhood]]. Now, Defias mechanical [[Harvest Watcher]]s and agents of the Brotherhood control the farm. Nearby, you can find [[Farmer Furlbrow]] and his wife who have fled their own farm, [[Furlbrow's Pumpkin Patch]]. They give most adventurers their first quests in Westfall.

